GIVEN `the judge to whom an application has been made under paragraph (3)(c) cannot act or continue to act under this section for any reason` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 488.1(7) subsequent applications under paragraph (3)(c) may be made to another judge` MEANS
    IF `the judge to whom an application has been made under paragraph (3)(c) cannot act or continue to act under this section for any reason`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Where the judge to whom an application has been made under paragraph (3)(c) cannot act or continue to act under this section for any reason"

-- covers: 488.1(8)
